work_item=livespec-dev-tooling-aplxhg
reason=Fix the release window's job-level if: so release-please.yml parses. #3317 left that expression as a plain YAML scalar containing ': ' ('chore(master): release'), which GitHub rejects, so every Release Please run since 19:49Z failed at workflow parse and releases stopped. Quoting the expression restores the ratified v235 behaviour unchanged.
